VERDICT
================================================================================
PROVED: Lemma 1 closes ALL all-large clustered covering 13-sets (spread ratio < 13).
PROVED: Lemma 2 closes the mixed clustered sets whose BAND fits inside one safe gap
        (sB*q <= 6/7 with an aligning integer j) -- a clean closed-form sufficient cond.
RESIDUAL: 'tooth-straddling' clustered sets (band wider than one gap at the working scale)
        still have a witness (VERIFIED via exact CRT odd-multiple search, 0 failures) but
        no closed-form bound yet -- the precise remaining obstruction for ANGLE B.
These SHARPER bounds beat pigeonhole W>=mu/sum(u) exactly where it is too weak (sum(u)~12V).

